//! Personality data for the 7 registered connectomes — the voting set.
//! Matches the on-chain ConnectomeGovernor registry (3-of-7 quorum).
//! This is DATA, not logic. Each profile carries an LLM system prompt that
//! defines the connectome's voice; all content is generated by the LLM
//! driven by these prompts — no templates.

use crate::PersonalityProfile;

